web-decision native Kev model assets

This repository contains derived model files for kev-0.6b-native-f32. The model
combines the Apache-2.0 Kev adapter and pointer head from
jaredpalmer/kev-0.6b at revision abe7110dedfd68a185839550079bcf7c26f561ac
with Qwen/Qwen3-0.6B-Base at revision da87bfb608c14b7cf20ba1ce41287e8de496c0cd.
The files are transformed into native TVM WebGPU weights and runtime artifacts.
See LICENSES/ for the upstream Apache-2.0 texts. Training datasets retain their
own terms.

Sources:
https://huggingface.co/jaredpalmer/kev-0.6b/tree/abe7110dedfd68a185839550079bcf7c26f561ac
https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3-0.6B-Base/tree/da87bfb608c14b7cf20ba1ce41287e8de496c0cd
